 "cards": [
  {
   "dot": "cyan",
   "title": "Primary path: post → respond → chat",
   "items": [
    "App writes posts and responses through PostgREST; triggers set expiry, counters and search vectors",
    "A response creates a conversation; Realtime streams new messages to both phones",
    "Feed and search are Postgres RPCs: feed_nearby (PostGIS), feed_recommended, search_all (stemmed)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "dot": "emerald",
   "title": "Trust boundaries",
   "items": [
    "Client holds only the anon key; every call carries the user's JWT and RLS decides row access",
    "businesses_public view hides phone, WhatsApp and email; storage objects live under <business_id>/",
    "Service role and the Anthropic key exist only inside Edge Functions and the scheduled job"
   ]
  },
  {
   "dot": "amber",
   "title": "Not on the diagram",
   "items": [
    "Forms are data: intentions → post_types → form_schemas with EN + HI templates",
    "Without ANTHROPIC_API_KEY, ai-generate returns template copy; expire-posts runs via service-role wrappers",
    "Local stack: supabase start + Metro :8081; checks: typecheck, lint, unit, 39-test E2E"
   ]
  }
 ]
